ing model for automated detection of ADHD from fMRI data. Clin EEG Neurosci 54(2):151&#x2013;159. https://doi.org/10.1177/15500594221122699</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1177/15500594221122699</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">36052402</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Firouzi M, Ahmadi M, Kazemi K, Helfroush MS, Aarabi A (2023) Deep convolutional neural network for ADHD classification using resting-state fMRI. In: 2023 31st International Conference on Electrical Engineering (ICEE). IEEE, pp 877&#x2013;880. https://doi.org/10.1109/ICEE59167.2023.10334844</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Dey A, Singh J, Rathore M, Govind R, Ladwani VM (2023) Discrimination of attention deficit hyperactivity disorder using capsule networks and LSTM networks on fMRI data. In: International Conference on Engineering Applications of Neural Networks. Springer Nature Switzerland, Cham, pp 291&#x2013;302. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-34204-2_25</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Craddock C, Benhajali Y, Chu C, Chouinard F, Evans A, Jakab A, Khundrakpam BS, Lewis JD, Li Q, Milham M, Yan C (2013) The neuro bureau preprocessing initiative: open sharing of preprocessed neuroimaging data and derivatives. Front Neuroinform 7(27):5</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Bellec P, Chu C, Chouinard-Decorte F, Benhajali Y, Margulies DSR (2017) The Neuro Bureau ADHD-200 preprocessed repository. Neuroimage 144(Part B):275&#x2013;286</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.neuroimage.2016.06.034</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">27423255</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>He K, Zhang X, Ren S, Sun J (2016) Deep residual learning for image recognition. In: Proceedings of the IEEE conference on computer vision and pattern recognition, pp 770&#x2013;778</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Chollet F (2017) Xception: deep learning with depthwise separable convolutions. In: Pro