  def mon2num: {\"Jan\":\"01\",\"Feb\":\"02\",\"Mar\":\"03\",\"Apr\":\"04\",\"May\":\"05\",\"Jun\":\"06\",\"Jul\":\"07\",\"Aug\":\"08\",\"Sep\":\"09\",\"Oct\":\"10\",\"Nov\":\"11\",\"Dec\":\"12\"};
  def normdate("'$s):
    ($s | gsub("'"\\\\s+\";\" \") | sub(\""'^'"\\\\s+\";\"\") | sub(\"\\\\s+"'$";"")) as $d
    | if ($d|test("''^[0-9]{4}$")) then "'"\\("'$d)-01-01"
      elif ($d|test("''^[0-9]{4} [A-Za-z]{3}$")) then
        ($d|capture("(?<y>[0-9]{4}) (?<m>[A-Za-z]{3})")) as $c
        | "'"\\("'$c.y)-'"\\(mon2num["'$c.m])-01"
      elif ($d|test("''^[0-9]{4} [A-Za-z]{3} [0-9]{1,2}$")) then
        ($d|capture("(?<y>[0-9]{4}) (?<m>[A-Za-z]{3}) (?<day>[0-9]{1,2})")) as $c
        | "'"\\("'$c.y)-'"\\(mon2num["'$c.m])-'"\\(("'$c.day|tonumber|tostring)|if length==1 then "0" + . else . end)"
      else null
      end;

  .result as $r
  | ($abs[0] // {}) as $a
  | ($r.uids // [])
  | map($r[.])
  | map({
      title: (.title // ""),
      summary: (($a[.uid] // "") | if . == "" then "No abstract available in source." else . end),
      url: ("https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/'"\\(.uid)/\"),
      category: \"Autism\",
      source: \"pubmed\",
      journal: (.source // \"\"),
      published_date: normdate(.pubdate // \"\"),
      date: "'$today
    })
  | map(select(.published_date != null and .published_date >= $cutoff and .published_date <= $today))
  | unique_by(.url)
'"' \""'$TMP_DIR/esummary.json" > "$TMP_DIR/new_articles.json"

if [ -f "$OUT" ]; then
  jq --arg today "$TODAY" --slurpfile new "$TMP_DIR/new_articles.json" '"'
    . as "'$old
    | {
        date: $today,
        articles: (($old.articles // []) + ($new[0] // []) | unique_by(.url))
      }
  '"' \""'$OUT" > "$TMP_DIR/merged.json"
else
  jq --arg today "$TODAY" --slurpfile new "$TMP_DIR/new_articles.json" '"'{date:"'$today, articles:($new[0] // [])}'"' > \""'$TMP_DIR/merged.json"
fi

mv "$TMP_DIR/merged.json" "$OUT"
echo "written_empty=false"
echo "new_count=$(jq '"'length' \""'$TMP_DIR/new_articles.json")"
echo "final_count=$(jq '"'.articles|length' \""'$OUT")"
